# tree-sitter grammars (src/mcp/ast-parser-mcp/grammars/)

The `.wasm` files in that directory are third-party code, vendored unchanged (E-98) from the
`tree-sitter-wasms` 0.1.13 package (released into the public domain under the Unlicense), which
compiles each grammar from its upstream project. Each upstream project is MIT-licensed; its
licence travels with the copies below (E-365, audit L3). Rein's own licence
does not apply to these files.

| File | Upstream project | Version range built by tree-sitter-wasms |
|---|---|---|
| `tree-sitter-javascript.wasm` | https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-javascript | ^0.20.3 |
| `tree-sitter-typescript.wasm`, `tree-sitter-tsx.wasm` | https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-typescript | ^0.20.5 |

